# NOTE on client data:
# Matter files (matters/<slug>/) hold real, privileged client data. They ARE
# tracked and DO sync — that is deliberate: this repo is August's memory, and
# Michael works matters from Cowork on his phone against the GitHub copy.
# Therefore the GitHub repository MUST be PRIVATE. If it were ever made public,
# add `matters/` (except `matters/_TEMPLATE/` and `matters/README.md`),
# `intake/`, and `research/memos/` here immediately.
